# Line endings are LF, in the repository and in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# This is not housekeeping.  The bench moves between a Mac and a Windows PC by copying the
# working tree across, and on one such trip Windows rewrote three files as CRLF.  A change
# of 565 lines in klinebsl.py then arrived looking like a 5446-line rewrite of a 2500-line
# file, which hides the review in the noise — and reviewing what came back is the only
# thing standing between someone else's session and this ECU.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never let any of that machinery near a binary.  The photographs carry redactions and the
# stage blobs are checked byte-for-byte against the assembler's output; a helpful newline
# conversion in either would be silent and would not be caught by reading a diff.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.bin binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.zip binary
